<div class="py-4">

    <h1 class="mb-3">📖 Scam Glossary</h1>

    <p class="text-muted">
        Learn about common scam types, how they work, and how you can protect yourself.
    </p>

    <input
        type="text"
        class="form-control mb-4"
        placeholder="Search scam types...">

    <div class="card mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4>🎣 Phishing Scam</h4>
            <p>Scammers impersonate trusted organisations through fake emails, SMS messages or websites to steal personal information.</p>

            <strong>Prevention:</strong>

            <ul>
                <li>Never click suspicious links.</li>
                <li>Verify the sender before responding.</li>
                <li>Enable two-factor authentication.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4>💰 Investment Scam</h4>

            <p>Promises of guaranteed profits with little or no risk to convince victims to transfer money.</p>

            <strong>Prevention:</strong>

            <ul>
                <li>Research every investment opportunity.</li>
                <li>Never rush financial decisions.</li>
                <li>Verify companies through MAS.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4>💼 Job Scam</h4>

            <p>Fraudsters offer fake jobs and request registration fees or sensitive personal information.</p>

            <strong>Prevention:</strong>

            <ul>
                <li>Legitimate employers do not ask for payment.</li>
                <li>Research the company before applying.</li>
                <li>Be cautious of unusually high salaries.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4>❤️ Love Scam</h4>

            <p>Scammers build romantic relationships online before asking victims for money.</p>

            <strong>Prevention:</strong>

            <ul>
                <li>Never send money to someone you've never met.</li>
                <li>Watch out for emotional manipulation.</li>
                <li>Video call before building trust.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
// Shawn End